{
  "$schema": "../../schemas/asset.schema.json",
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "id": "parallel-mirrors",
  "title": "Images in two mirrors (দুটি আয়নায় প্রতিবিম্ব)",
  "type": "interactive",
  "entry": "index.html",
  "version": "0.3.1",
  "book": "physics-9-10",
  "page": 216,
  "topic": "8.2.1",
  "placement": "Book page 216, topic 8.2.1, the উদাহরণ with চিত্র ৮.০৪ (a candle between two parallel mirrors M₁ and M₂, with its images x′, x″, x‴ … in a row on both sides, d₁ d₂ d₃ d₄).",
  "order": 1,
  "maintainers": ["RadeenXALNW"],
  "units": "cm",
  "description": "Interactive 3D figure for the উদাহরণ on book page 216, topic 8.2.1, চিত্র ৮.০৪. It starts simply and builds up one slow tap at a time: a lit candle x and one silvered-glass mirror M₁ with its image x′ and the equal distance d₁ before and behind it; then M₂ slides in with its own x′ and d₂; then the first x′ acts as an object for M₂ and makes x″, with one ray traced segment by segment to the eye; the same on the other side, x″ and x‴ with d₃ and d₄; then the row fades in one image at a time and the camera looks into M₁, where the same images stand as a real pair of mirrors shows them. Only then comes the book's whole picture with all its distances. The candle has a visible drag handle, and every image follows it to its exact place. The view turns all the way round. Any named image can be tapped to trace its light. Five test questions. Offline, Bangla and English.",
  "tags": [
    "light",
    "reflection",
    "plane-mirror",
    "parallel-mirrors",
    "image",
    "multiple-images",
    "virtual-image",
    "bangla"
  ],
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "lang",
      "label": "Language",
      "type": "select",
      "options": [["bn", "বাংলা"], ["en", "English"]],
      "default": "bn"
    },
    {
      "name": "step",
      "label": "Step of the book",
      "type": "select",
      "options": [
        ["one", "One mirror"],
        ["two", "Second mirror"],
        ["image", "Its image"],
        ["again", "Once more"],
        ["many", "Countless"],
        ["book", "The book's picture"]
      ],
      "default": "one"
    },
    {
      "name": "x",
      "label": "Candle on the row (cm from the middle of the gap, −7 to 7)",
      "type": "number",
      "default": "5"
    },
    { "name": "stage", "label": "How many taps into the step (0–2)", "type": "number", "default": "0" },
    { "name": "view", "label": "View", "type": "select", "options": ["front", "3d"], "default": "front" },
    {
      "name": "mode",
      "label": "Start in",
      "type": "select",
      "options": [["explore", "learn"], ["quiz", "test"]],
      "default": "explore"
    },
    { "name": "coach", "label": "The ring on the part pulses at first", "type": "boolean", "default": "1" },
    {
      "name": "numerals",
      "label": "Digits",
      "type": "select",
      "options": [["", "follow language"], ["bn", "Bangla"], ["latin", "Latin"]],
